<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Entitlements of the helper app "Iamb Service.app" (iamb-service: supervisor and worker),
  signed with the hardened runtime.

  Deliberately empty. The helper observes keys with an event tap and posts synthetic keys;
  macOS controls both through the user's Accessibility and Input Monitoring grants (TCC),
  which are given to the helper's signed identity in System Settings and are not entitlements
  of an app outside the sandbox (architecture §5, ADR-0021). It has no network code (ADR-0008),
  sends no Apple Events, and loads no code that is not signed with it, so no hardened-runtime
  exception applies. Add a key here only with the reason next to it (docs/release.md).
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict/>
</plist>
